{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18089","headline":"初南食贻元十八协律 · 韩愈","name":"初南食贻元十八协律","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鲎实如惠文，骨眼相负行。\n蚝相黏爲山，百十各自生。\n蒲鱼尾如蛇，口眼不相营。\n蛤即是虾蟆，同实浪异名。\n章举马甲柱，鬬以怪自呈。\n其余数十种，莫不可叹惊。\n我来御魑魅，自宜味南烹。\n调以咸与酸，芼以椒与橙。\n腥臊始发越，咀吞面汗騂。\n惟蛇旧所识，实惮口眼狞。\n开笼听其去，郁屈尚不平。\n卖尔非我罪，不屠岂非情。\n不祈灵珠报，幸无嫌怨幷。\n聊歌以记之，又以告同行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}